.TH IMPROV-SCENARIO 1 "" "improv" "Improv Manual"
.SH NAME
improv\-scenario \- Add an input\-cell override to a what\-if scenario
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBimprov scenario\fR [OPTIONS] <db> <scenario\-name> <measure> <value>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add an input\-cell override to a what\-if scenario.
.PP
The scenario is created if it is new. The base model is untouched; evaluate under it with eval ... \-\-scenario NAME. \-\-at takes the same forms as for set.
